(
    title: "Laser Blast",
    developer: Some("David Crane"),
    description: Some("You fly a saucer over a landscape of enemy ground emplacements, diving to strafe them with a laser fired from the ship\'s underside. Hovering is fatal: the gun crews\' radar locks onto a stationary ship, and each new wave forces you higher until there is no low ground left to hide in. A direct hit costs you a ship, though a crippled one can still be steered down onto an attacker to take it with you."),
